    <values><field>LongDescription__c</field><value xsi:type="xsd:string">Finds: blng__Invoice__c records in Draft status whose CreatedDate is more than 30 days ago.
Why it matters: Draft invoices that linger represent revenue not yet recognized and AR not yet tracked. Finance loses visibility into the real pipeline of billings and customers don&apos;t see invoices for work delivered.
Suppress a finding: for invoices intentionally held in Draft pending a contractual sign-off.
Disable the detector: only when long-held drafts are normal. Most should leave this on.</value></values>
